<title>SWEDEN: Astra says own '96 Losec sales up 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Astra says own '96 Losec sales up 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish pharmaceutical company Astra AB said on Wednesday 1996 its own sales of its anti-ulcer agent Losec rose 23 percent to 17.56 billion crowns from 15.28 billion crowns in 1995.</p>
<p>Total Losec sales, including sales by licensees, amounted to 24.63 billion crowns against 21.00 billion a year earlier.</p>
